// ===== l9 · Goethe B2 · Set 4 (from L7/new_all.js, checked by tests/exam_lint.js) + Set 4 Hören 1–4 written by l9 =====
// ===== L7 · Goethe B2 · Modellsatz 4 · Lesen (5 Teile, 30 Aufgaben, 65 Minuten) =====
// Same shape as EXAM_SEEDS2.goethe. New optional fields: set (binds the five Teile of one mock exam),
